sequenceDiagram
 participant User as Postman
 participant Api as CustomerController
 participant Logic as CustomerService
 participant DB as MongoDB
 User->>Api: Register customer
 Api->>Logic: RxJava Single
 Logic->>DB: Spring Data reactive request
 DB-->>Logic: Mono/Flux response
 Logic-->>Api: RxJava result
 Api-->>User: HTTP JSON response
